put.summary:
Change the policy of passwords and of the lockout (administrator). Asking for less
anywhere needs the password confirmed a moment before. New rules apply to new passwords;
the age of a password counts from its last change.

Make an uploaded image the avatar of one's own account: an upload of the purpose
`avatar` — a JPEG, PNG or WebP image up to 1 MB. Every member of the organization sees it;
its thumbnails are `GET /files/{file}/thumbs/{size}`.

post.summary:
Issue a personal token. Needs the password confirmed just now (`POST /auth/step-up`);
the policy of the organization decides who may, for how long and with which permissions.
The value comes once, in this answer.

Send a public form: anyone with its link. The task of the proof-of-work given by
the form must be answered, once; the sendings of a form and of an address are limited;
the record is by nobody, written with the rights of who made the link.
